  "id": "spinach-and-cheese-stuffed-pasta-shells",
  "name": "Spinach and Cheese Stuffed Pasta Shells",
  "subtitle": "Ricotta-filled shells baked with spinach and tomato sauce",
  "description": "Tender jumbo shells filled with seasoned ricotta, spinach, and Parmesan, then baked in spaghetti sauce.",
  "meal_type": "main",
  "cuisine": "Italian Inspired",
  "yield": {
    "quantity": 6,
